<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak March jobless drops to 13.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak March jobless drops to 13.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Slovakia in</p>
<p>March 1997 totalled 349,658, or 13.44 percent of the</p>
<p>workforce, down from 356,181 or 13.69 percent in February, the</p>
<p>National Labour Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	MARCH 1997   FEB 1997    MARCH 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		349,658	356,181     342,654</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce   13.44	  13.69	 13.30</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
